From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:57:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: apply stock's
 eUSB2 repeater tuning

Stock overrides one eUSB2 repeater register in device mode: 0x57 (TUNE_USB2_PREEM) = 3. Use the driver's
property for it.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index 9da2d9733e5c..32300636767a 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -1332,6 +1332,9 @@ sde_disp0_rst_1p8_active: sde-disp0-rst-1p8-active-state {
 &pmih0108_e1_eusb2_repeater {
 	vdd18-supply = <&vreg_l15b_1p8>;
 	vdd3-supply = <&vreg_l5b_3p1>;
+
+	/* stock's device-mode override: TUNE_USB2_PREEM (0x57) = 3 */
+	qcom,tune-usb2-preem = /bits/ 8 <3>;
 };
 
 &pmk8850_vadc {
-- 
2.43.0

